{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7bd4dced1c029d16f5a698fce752c7aca5cad038de244d3df8a7df0e938a9260", "ja": "{$P$}。お茶、どうですか？", "zh": "{$P$}。要喝茶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1001_p", "source_sha256": "092b8c4eec9e08bb6a8b5a4177e46db93fb65bca53cd80c3f87141e580ce2593", "ja": "ありがとう雪歩、もらうよ。\nあれ……変わった味だな？", "zh": "谢谢你，雪步。我收下了。\n咦……味道真特别啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4f377f8669bbedd1b4a9a2c52522d8d6f46a088cf1c5518acbcae11454b22448", "ja": "ハーブティーと煎茶の、デトックスブレンドなんです。\nこの前行ったエステで、売ってたんです。", "zh": "这是香草茶和煎茶调配的排毒茶。\n我之前去的美容院里有卖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ce8fd0b928d391ba19342912a0cc07859069a7958178d07ae29ee4d626b1fdf0", "ja": "デトックスか。なるほど、これは毒気が抜けそうだな。\n飲むと体の重荷が取れて、スッキリする感じだ。", "zh": "排毒啊。原来如此，这个确实感觉能把毒气排出去。\n喝下去后，感觉身体的负担都消除了，整个人神清气爽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5661b4f7c8a09e426ac5b39c024cb88a23fe8d67c616904ab8bb889160e97a87", "ja": "はい、スッキリ……。あの、{$P$}。\n毒って、時々は吐いたほうがいいんでしょうか？", "zh": "嗯，清爽多了……那个，{$P$}。\n毒素，偶尔还是应该排出来一些吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3964458642701dc514c5b1848dba74857cd504da5edec11478bb064808cf1fd7", "ja": "そうだな。まあ、溜め込まないほうが\n健康にいいと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。不过，我觉得还是别憋在心里，对健康比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7600db5b5dda425a32bc7a82f2845404814309ef588e68d056fc3417db9cda57", "ja": "ですよね……。あ、あの。\n私、なんだか怪しい噂を聞いたんです。", "zh": "就是说……啊，那个。\n我好像听到了一些奇怪的传闻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e9143ca1c45f883d6f9c8e0d3c2cecce0fbf651cda301889e386ad5455c8ff7d", "ja": "ん？　噂……。", "zh": "嗯？传闻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "66768446ab6b9f1a59733470091ca7350502e685de6e4246ba627209c2890ebe", "ja": "{$P$}の噂です。\nいろんな女の子を、困らせているとか……。", "zh": "是关于{$P$}的传闻。\n说是让很多女孩子，都感到很为难之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d1357e2c9a1daed43f075962c485ae3ad5fe965fb1f64fdbcb7fde2bb5c31d8e", "ja": "え？　いや、そんな事はないと思うけど……。", "zh": "诶？不，我觉得没有那回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3c1e4b7737415f16016a64531c3450bba4d0f211f6f8cb495f234f8b8563c371", "ja": "仕事にかこつけて、女の子を怒らせたり……\nな、泣かせたりして、反応を見てるんだわ！って……。", "zh": "借着工作为借口，把女孩子惹生气……\n还、还把人家弄哭，观察反应！她是这么说的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1011_p", "source_sha256": "db1c5bf1cb784054e76d937fa0c46ff46b12528a54413a2390ecbd65d6862881", "ja": "えええ……いったい、誰がそんな。", "zh": "诶诶诶……到底是谁会做那种事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "191cb378aa6e2d14578d62542f72231c0d74a0bdc1b7655ea70f7ee722caa3d6", "ja": "もう、信じられない！　サイテー！\n{$P$}くんのばかー！", "zh": "真是的，难以置信！差劲透了！\n{$P$}你这个大笨蛋——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7d04030d470fcb4061761704d62af082bf1aba5923ed89741f09d7ec2c76eb06", "ja": "……って、莉緒さんが言ってましたけど\n本当ですか？", "zh": "……莉绪小姐是这么说的，\n是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ba566d775eb62b4bfbb7e32a4d10b378e09dbd718722a515705bd3ebdbe4addd", "ja": "事実無根だ！！", "zh": "毫无根据！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b0a01cb602f557b9c8a75e4ada766a808ac2b3003f4cdb8205c213c036425b25", "ja": "ほっ。じゃあやっぱり、\n根も葉もない噂だったんですね。", "zh": "呼。那果然是毫无根据的传闻呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d10f229558deed0229bde43ae375b3b2e96de508f442c942b9f660aecdfad052", "ja": "ああ。信じてくれるのか、雪歩。", "zh": "啊。你相信我吗，雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "429d945ceb66d9eefb7a5f73e90cbe1f3730583417973be7c93d2ab778929932", "ja": "もちろんですー。ふぅ……安心しました。\n思いきって聞けてよかったです。えへへ。", "zh": "那是当然的啦～呼……我放心了。\n能鼓起勇气问出口真是太好了。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0233_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a46d1bc0522535f7d60b83fa939fa0ae5b1d56433b951e85ea5292ac5820fe5c", "ja": "あ。そのお茶、根っこと葉っぱを煎じたんですよ。\n私もたくさん飲んで、デトックス、デトックス。", "zh": "啊。那个茶是用根和叶子煎的。\n我也要多喝一点，排毒，排毒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
